## 2. Upload Progress & Creation Feedback Architecture

To give the admin instant visual feedback on multi-megabyte media uploads (R2 photos and videos):

### A. Global Upload Interceptor (`buExploreAdmin/src/api/axiosClient.js`)
- Axios request interceptor automatically attaches an `onUploadProgress` listener to all `multipart/form-data` requests.
- Calculates loaded bytes vs. total bytes, percentage (0% to 100%), and friendly status text:
  - `0% - 85%`: *"Uploading media (X%)..."*
  - `85% - 99%`: *"Almost done uploading..."*
  - `100%`: *"Upload complete! Saving & processing on Cloudflare R2 / Server..."*
- Dispatches events to `UploadProgressContext` via `notifyUploadProgress`.

### B. Global Floating Widget (`components/GlobalUploadProgressWidget.jsx`)
- Fixed at the bottom-right corner of the screen.
- Displays live percentage badge, byte counter (e.g., `4.2 MB / 8.5 MB`), animated spinner, and success/error state.

### C. In-Modal Creation Progress (`components/UploadProgressBar.jsx`)
- Embedded in the sticky footer of all creation modals.
- Features smooth gradient track (`bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-emerald-500`) with dynamic width.
- Submit buttons automatically show `<Loader2 size={16} className="animate-spin" />` and descriptive text (`"Uploading Assets & Saving..."`), while disabling double-clicks (`disabled={isSaving}`).

