## 6. Notification 3-Day Retention & Read Receipts

### Retention Update
- **Old Retention:** 24 hours (86,400 seconds).
- **New Retention:** **3 days** (259,200 seconds / 72 hours).
- **Files Modified:**
  - `BuExploreBackend/config/notificationConfig.js`: `RETENTION_DAYS = 3`, `RETENTION_SECONDS = 259200`.
  - `BuExploreBackend/utils/cronJobs.js`: Automated hourly cleanup for records older than 3 days.
  - `BuExploreBackend/services/notificationService.js`: Database query threshold set to 3 days.
  - MongoDB TTL index updated via `collMod` to expire at `259200` seconds.

